cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "PBCM underwriting simulation for embedded merchant cash advances"
abstract: >-
  Fully synthetic evaluation suite for the Platform Behavioral Credit Model
  (PBCM) described in "AI-Driven Underwriting for Embedded Merchant Cash
  Advances: A Financial Platform Engineering Framework for E-Commerce
  Marketplaces" (v2). Generates seller populations and repayment paths from a
  stated data-generating process, compares behavioural-feature underwriting
  with a bureau-proxy baseline out of time, derives expected-loss pricing,
  evaluates repayment-velocity monitoring, and reports approval parity. No
  platform, lender, customer or company data is used or required.
type: software
